=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211360/extras/20878e97ba3a97c40dfe2c0f07532224.avif?t=1728446252\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>- Rescue Arachelle the Spider Queen from the Killer Wasps and make her covet for your strong, manly semen!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211360/extras/4850fc681428d0fe25fe3c773994612e.avif?t=1728446252\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>- Once the 6 Impossible Quests are complete, the secretly-horny werewolf Guild Clerk Romula will fall for you!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211360/extras/771fe105455d19f965edacecb12904b4.avif?t=1728446252\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>- Enjoy the two default role-plays 'Vanilla and Stepmom &amp; Stepson' upon seducing the 7 MILFs! Oh, and a few kinky fetishes too!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211360/extras/584d37f98e53b3eb5789fc4567ae5155.avif?t=1728446252\" width=630 height=360 /></span><br><br>- Unlock 'Master &amp; Servant' role-play by defeating the final boss, the Kraken of Lake Drake!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211360/extras/c8636ed787504b47af2866a89deccaef.avif?t=1728446252\" width=644 height=360 /></span><br><br>- Greet a familiar face at Lustilos Express, where you will have to barter for key items to progress through quests!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211360/extras/4e74a38bd0376c5f21b4ddf3c4b0e961.avif?t=1728446252\" width=640 height=360 /></span>",
